:: University_MainRoad
    <img class='scene' src='img/street.jpg'>
    The road is long, but lined with many small and some large houses.

    <<nobr>>
        <div class='passage-links-grid-1'>
            <<button [[University Courtyard | University_MainCourtyard]]>>
            <<calcTime 10 5>>
            <</button>>
            <<button [[Main Gate | University_Gate]]>>
                <<calcTime 10 5>>
            <</button>>
            <<button [[Starr Residence Courtyard | Residence_Starr_Courtyard]]>>
                <<calcTime 10 5>>
            <</button>>
        </div>
    <</nobr>>

:: University_MainCourtyard
    <img class='scene' src='img/university_courtyard.jpg'>
    <<speech 'plr'>>Yup, that's a magical looking courtyard alright.<</speech>>
    <<nobr>>
        <div class='passage-links-grid-1'>
            <<button [[University Entrance | University_Entrance]]>>
                <<calcTime 5 5>>
            <</button>>
            <<button [[University Road | University_MainRoad]]>>
                <<calcTime 5 5>>
            <</button>>
        </div>
    <</nobr>>

:: University_Gate
    <img class='scene' src='img/university_gate.jpg'>
    <<speech 'plr'>>Now that is a gate! Sadly, it looks very much locked. And the air seems to shimmer along the outer wall. An illusion? Maybe a shield? Not sure yet.<</speech>>
    <<nobr>>
        <div class='passage-links-grid-1'>
            <<button [[University Main Road | University_MainRoad]]>>
                <<calcTime 0 5>>
            <</button>>
        </div>
    <</nobr>>

